    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i think i just ruined everything. i was looking at the latest dataset results today and it’s all wrong. the whole core of my thesis... the last three years... it was based on a fundamental error in the initial processing. i can't even fix it. it's just gone. i feel like i've wasted my entire life for nothing. i can't even face my advisor. what am i even doing here?",
